{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(<i>Currently in an Alpha Development. Join the Discord for early playtesting!)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482770/extras/save_to_score_wishlist_now_footer.gif?t=1749260974\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to <strong>THE PITCH</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>The Pitch</i></strong><i>\u00a0</i>is a zero-gravity, momentum-based arena sport where two teams compete to pass, dash, and use teamwork to throw or slam the ball into the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Momentum-based movement with a physics-based ball</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grab teammates and use their momentum (and teamwork) to soar across the arena</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Air dash for fast and fluid direction changes - fake out the opposition!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grab opponents and stun them to stop them in their tracks to shift the game momentum</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manual passing and shooting for a high skill ceiling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gamepad and KBM compatible</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quick 5 minute matches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2v2 and 1v1</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic PVP matchups make for endless replayability</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Character customization - express yourself</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Planned competitive/ranked modes for unlocking exclusive cosmetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Planned multiple  environments\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482770/extras/stun_opponent_steal_ball_and_dash.gif?t=1749260974\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With wall and player-based jumps, air dashes, and game-changing stuns, every moment is a fast, fluid test of reflexes and teamwork.\u00a0Tight controls and dynamic matchups make every play feel fresh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482770/extras/soar_and_score.gif?t=1749260974\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3482770?t=1749260974","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3482770?t=1749260974","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482770/5690bb94700b2137e7abca68cf0a5363b60d9b2b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749260974","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482770/5690bb94700b2137e7abca68cf0a5363b60d9b2b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749260974","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(<i>Currently in an Alpha Development. Join the Discord for early playtesting!)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482770/extras/save_to_score_wishlist_now_footer.gif?t=1749260974\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to <strong>THE PITCH</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>The Pitch</i></strong><i>\u00a0</i>is a zero-gravity, momentum-based arena sport where two teams compete to pass, dash, and use teamwork to throw or slam the ball 